{
  "_readme": "vram_free.json (v1.5). apps = GPU-hungry apps vram_free.ps1 -Free may close GRACEFULLY (WM_CLOSE to all their windows / or the app's own shutdown command). protected = never touched, always wins over apps. Edit 'enabled' to switch single apps off. Nothing here is ever killed unless -Force is given on the command line (and then only what did not close by itself).",
